@startuml
title Current system and the remaining connections
top to bottom direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam wrapWidth 190
skinparam maxMessageSize 160
actor "User" as user
component "Browser\nDashboard + Chat" as browser
component "Next.js :3000\n/api/* proxy" as next
component "FastAPI :8000\nPlaid / Dashboard / Chat\nBudget / Alerts" as api
component "Plaid service\nlink, sync, balances, debts" as service
cloud "Plaid Sandbox" as plaid
database "App SQLite\naccounts, transactions, budgets,\nalerts, advice, runs" as db
component "Privacy gateway\nallowlisted financial context" as gateway
component "Chat graph\nretrieve -> agent <-> tools" as chat
component "Budget graph\nCLI / HTTP + approval core" as budget
component "Ollama :11434\nqwen2.5:14b\nnomic-embed-text" as ollama
database "Local Chroma\npublic guidance" as kb
database "Checkpoint SQLite\nchat + budget files" as checkpoints
component "PLANNED\nScheduler + close orchestration" as scheduler #FFF0D5
component "IN PROGRESS\nBudget / Alerts frontend" as ui #FFF0D5
user --> browser
browser --> next : same origin
next --> api : HTTP / SSE
api --> service
service <--> plaid
service --> db : upsert
api --> db : dashboard reads
api --> chat
api --> budget : run / accept / dismiss
chat --> gateway : account / debt / spending tools
gateway --> db : scoped reads
gateway --> chat : minimized JSON
chat --> kb : retrieve every question
chat --> ollama : chat calls
kb --> ollama : embeddings
chat --> checkpoints
budget --> db : evaluate + write advice
budget --> gateway : diagnose context
budget --> ollama : classify + decide
budget --> checkpoints : pause / resume
scheduler ..> budget : daily trigger
ui ..> browser : pages being built
note bottom of db
No money movement.
Auth is a single demo user.
end note
legend bottom
Solid = present in reviewed code
Dashed / PLANNED = a remaining connection
IN PROGRESS = partially implemented TPC-20
endlegend
@enduml
